WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:07.100
Luffy is going to have the most ridiculously
large and powerful army at the end of one

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.100
piece.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:13.340
We all expect, that this epic series will
have one of the most epic and intense final

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.789
battles we have seen in all of Anime.

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:21.710
Eiichiro Oda, the author of one piece himself
has mentioned more than once, that he is working

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:27.689
heatedly on a war that will make the battle
of Marineford look like a playground scruff

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:29.680
between a few third graders.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.860
So assuming that Luffy will actually have
to call all his allies for help is not so

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.910
much speculation as a promise, by Oda-sensei
himself.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:44.830
And so I think it's time to take a look at
all the allies that Luffy has gathered over

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:51.060
the years, that will fight this all-deciding
final war side by side with him against the

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:55.160
full power of the world government, the Gorosei
and Imu.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:01:01.230
A war to liberate the world from a tyrannical
and exploitative rule, that has lasted for

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.470
over 800 years.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:10.240
Because as you will realise at the end of
this video, this host is so large and powerful,

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:17.149
that it really raises the question of what
the government has up their sleeve to compete

00:01:17.149 --> 00:01:18.149
with it.

00:01:18.149 --> 00:01:23.560
At the core of this army of all armies stands
of course the straw hat crew itself, under

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:29.670
the command of the future pirate king Monkey
D. Luffy, a fitting title for a commander

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.240
that will lead such a massive host.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:38.119
The straw hats have pretty much established
themselves as a true Yonko crew at this point.

00:01:38.119 --> 00:01:44.299
The top fighters, namely Luffy, Zoro, Sanji,
Jinbe and most likely Yamato are powerful

00:01:44.299 --> 00:01:48.889
enough to take on pretty much any opponent
on the grand line at this point.

00:01:48.889 --> 00:01:54.679
And even the weakest members, like Usopp,
Nami or Robin have reached a terrifying level

00:01:54.679 --> 00:01:55.700
of power in battle.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:00.869
As a crew with unwavering believe and a wide
variety of devil fruit abilities and other

00:02:00.869 --> 00:02:06.049
useful skills, the straw hat will lead the
final fleet into battle.

00:02:06.049 --> 00:02:13.280
The first massive addition to the straw hat
army is of course the straw hat grand fleet,

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:17.100
that was established during the aftermath
of the Dressrosa arc.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:25.630
An impressive host of 5640 men, consisting
of seven pirate crews that were enslaved or

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:29.590
imprisoned by the Donquixote family in one
way or the other.

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:36.630
We're talking giants, long arms, the tontatta,
cavendish's crew and of course my man Bartholomeo.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:42.050
While the grand fleet will add impressive
numbers to the main army, I think it's important

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:48.120
to remember that many of its members are top
tier fighters, that fought in the colloseum.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:54.150
Many have haki or devil fruit powers and especially
the new giant warrior pirates under the lead

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:59.580
of Hajrudin, will have a massive impact on
the battle field.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:05.580
The other major force Luffy will be able to
count on is of course the Ninja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.670
Alliance, that was formed in front of the
Road Poneglyph on Zou.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:15.240
I personally think that this force will be
even more important and power-packed than

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.280
the grand fleet.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:22.170
The samurai and ninja of Wano are known as
probably the most powerful people in the entire

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:27.920
new world, with fighters strong enough to
oppose the government for centuries.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:34.090
Not only do most of them have advanced haki
in the form of Ryou, but the country is full

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:41.330
of special ability users, including the likes
of Onimaru, Tama or Momo, who has the same

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:45.110
mythical devil fruit as Kaido himself.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:49.680
Then there are the two pirate crews involved
in this as well, that have already fought

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.870
side by side with Luffy in a battle to the
death.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:58.300
Law's heart pirates and the Kid pirates, despite
their pride and brawls with Luffy, have been

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:03.830
established as allies and believers in Luffy,
that will stand by his side against a larger

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:07.130
evil, be it Kaido or the world government
itself.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:13.130
Wether other supernova will join the fray,
we'll have to wait and see, but many of them

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.250
do seem like likely candidates.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:21.049
X drake has already fought with Luffy, Hawkings
will probably switch sides, Bonny, who's connected

00:04:21.049 --> 00:04:27.070
to Kuma and has infiltrated Marijois, I could
see many of them standing side by side with

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.680
Luffy at the end as well.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:34.100
The minks of course aren't far off in terms
of their fighting power.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:41.250
They have been surviving and defending their
home against powerful invaders for centuries

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:49.430
as well and especially under the full-moon,
become one of the most fear-inducing weapons

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.410
you could wish for.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:57.639
Oh and speaking of their home country, Zuneshia,
the gignatuous elephant that Zou is located

00:04:57.639 --> 00:05:00.810
on is of course gonna be part of this as well.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:08.230
No matter if it's an actual ancient weapon
or just a monstrous walking tank of destruction,

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:13.450
Zuneshia is gonna have to play a central role
in the final battle, that most likely will

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:17.850
be tied to its past relationship with JoyBoy
in some way or form.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:24.290
And speaking of ancient weapons, and another
race that owes its freedom to the straw hats,

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.050
are Shirahoshi and the fishmen.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:32.370
Now that I think about it, I guess technically
Fishman island is actually still luffy's territory

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.660
if I'm not mistaken.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.920
With the fishman once again, we have once
again have a race of powerful fighters, that

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:41.990
has been suppressed and discriminated against
for hundreds of years.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:47.380
Not only are they able to fight underwater,
manipulate currents and attack ships from

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:53.830
below, but their princess, the ancient weapon
Poseidon, is literally able to control the

00:05:53.830 --> 00:06:00.699
sea kings, mysterious giant sea monsters,
similar to Zuneshia, who's powers are pretty

00:06:00.699 --> 00:06:02.690
much forces of nature.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:06.870
At this point I think two pretty clear patterns
emerge.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:13.010
Luffy's most terrifying ability, as Mihawk
calls it, to bring people to his side, fight

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:18.580
for him and believe in him, can be divided
into two categories: On the one hand you have

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:22.160
people who have been liberated and saved by
Luffy.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:28.080
This is true for pretty much all of the straw
hats in some way or form, Robin from Enies

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:33.520
Lobby, Sanji from Whole cake island, Joinbei
from impel down, but of course also for entire

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:37.919
islands, including the fishman, whom he saved
from hody jones and their internal dispute

00:06:37.919 --> 00:06:44.120
about their racial identity, wano from Kaido's
tyrannical rule or Law from his obsession

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:48.750
with Doflamingo and his quest to avenge Corazon.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:53.389
Luffy saving people and bringing them out
of their darkness, no matter who you are and

00:06:53.389 --> 00:06:58.980
what you have done, has always been one of
his most powerful character traits.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:04.500
My favorite example here is probably Katakuri,
whom Luffy saved from his isolation among

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:10.150
his crew and the pressure he felt to never
be himself and show any weakness.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:17.449
Katakuri by the way is also someone I really
expect to stand by Luffy's side at the end.

00:07:17.449 --> 00:07:23.479
On the other hand, there are also many people,
that Luffy has brought to his side by earning

00:07:23.479 --> 00:07:28.770
their respect and inspiring them to entrust
their hopes and dreams into him.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:32.290
A great example here would for example be
Whitebeard.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:37.950
Luffy did not manage to save either Whitebeard,
nor his brother Ace.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:44.250
But his actions and will earned him the Yonko's
respect and as a result, Luffy has the powerful

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:50.090
remnants of the Whitebeard pirates on his
side, including Marco and Izo, both of which

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.430
fought with him on Wano.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:56.729
In the same way, Luffy has inspired Mihawk
to help Zoro and very possibly help the crew

00:07:56.729 --> 00:07:58.250
again in the future.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:03.110
Even though there is of course more to it,
it is all the reason why Shanks and Rayleigh

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:09.740
and possibly other former members of the Roger
pirates will be fighting by his side as well.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.860
Eustass Kid, falls into this category as well.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:18.870
As I discussed in his character analysis video,
it was Luffy's stubbornness, his willingness

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:25.570
to die and fight for him without any second
thoughts, that ultimately made Kid trust him

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:29.880
fully.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:36.520
Another really big ally for Luffy in the final
battle will of course be his father dragon

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.420
and the revolutionary army as a whole.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:45.040
The revolutionary are already dangerous enough
as an organisation that Dragon has become

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:48.360
the most wanted man in the world.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:53.170
Not only do they have agents everywhere across
the globe and most likely inside the world

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:59.040
government ranks as well, but they also have
real heavy hitters in their ranks, including

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:05.860
the commanders, Luffy's brother sabo, Ivankov
and the entirety of the Kamabakka kingdom.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:11.440
And we're not even talking about all the possible
intel that Dragon might have about the true

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:15.210
history and the secrets of the world government.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:21.380
The revolutionaries might end up being one
of the most crucial pieces for Luffy's success

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:24.130
and the downfall of the Gorosei and Imu.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:31.710
But there are also forces within the marines
themselves, that seem likely to side with

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.530
Luffy at some point.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:38.760
Characters like Smoker or Fujitora, who have
opposed Luffy, but ended up respecting and

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:44.070
cheering for him as they witnessed his kindness
and more importantly the incompetency and

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:48.200
corruption of the government to keep its citizens
save from harm.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.670
You have characters like Koby, who not only
has been one of Luffy's friends since the

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:59.200
very beginning, but just like X Drake is part
of the secret marine organisation sword, that

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:05.390
is opposed to the the world Nobel's cruelty
and is fighting for a more just and fair version

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.520
of the marines.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:11.750
And of course we shouldn't forget Kuzan, who
has been friendly towards Luffy and the straw

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:19.360
hats right from the start and who has been
off doing his own mysterious thing for a while

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.270
now.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:25.410
He seems like the type of character who would
side with the straw hats in their fight for

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:31.640
a just and free world, which would add one
of the most powerful characters in the entire

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.870
story to Luffy's ranks.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:39.770
Someone who has control over the ocean itself
would be a more than valuable asset in the

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:40.900
final war.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:44.940
Luffy's Grandfather garp is another candidate
here.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:48.149
He will not watch another one of his grandkids
die.

00:10:48.149 --> 00:10:51.580
He will fight on Luffy's side in the next
big war.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:56.230
And there are even more potential allies that
might join the fight.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:11:00.839
The warriors of Skypea, another ancient race
associated with the ancient kingdom, might

00:11:00.839 --> 00:11:02.110
come to Luffy's aid.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:08.740
The giants of elbaf, another big arc that
is coming up, will surely also end up as allies

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:09.740
to the crew.

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:14.790
Similarly, soldiers from kingdoms like Drum
island with Dalton and Kureha, Dressrosa with

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:21.890
King Riku and rebekka and Alabasta with Vivi
should join the battle as well.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:26.430
And speaking of Dressrosa, Luffy liberated
the country from the rule of the Donxiquote

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:31.860
family, which includes the weirdly thin, but
very slimy Trebol.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:39.020
It has been my mission for a while now to
overtake his bounty of 99M berries.

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:46.000
With 100 berries per subscriber, we still
have 40M berries to go, so please help me

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.740
overtake this man by subscribing to the channel.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.740
More warlords.

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:55.040
Boa Hancock will be fighting for Luffy just
as surely as Zoro will.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:12:00.019
Many of the impel down prisoners that Luffy
helped break out, including Crocodile, Buggy

00:12:00.019 --> 00:12:03.300
and hopefully the one and only Mr. 2.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:07.170
Kuma, who was part of the revolutionaries
and has helped the crew before.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:13.360
And who knows, maybe Vegapunk will actually
turn out to be an ally as well, as many people

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:20.490
have speculated before, adding incredible
technical knowledge and prowess to the mix.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:26.490
Sanji's family the Vinsmokes and their Germa
army should be on their side at this point

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.490
as well.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:34.170
And the biggest wildcard of them all is most
likely Shanks and the red hair pirates.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:40.160
However, should they actually survive AND
be the good guys after all, having them join

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:44.950
Luffy's grand fleet would instantly increase
their power multiple times.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:51.149
I mean seriously, getting another Yonko crew
would just really turn this into the ultimate

00:12:51.149 --> 00:12:55.750
force to wage the largest war the world has
ever seen.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:01.040
So I just want you to close your eyes and
imagine this army for a second.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:06.110
While nations, the most powerful fighters
on the ocean, ancient weapons and invincible

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:10.080
Devil fruits all united under the straw hat
banner.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:19.760
All of this of course leaves us with one big
question: What sort of terrifying secret power

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:24.980
does the world government and Imu have up
their sleeve to counter this sort of army

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.680
to make it a fair fight?

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.850
The next arc on the way to this major battle
is going to be Elbaf.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:36.530
And if you want to know what might happen
on the island of the giants, you really shouldn't

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.400
ignore this video right here.

